"""
MemoryOS — Premium Upload API
=============================

Production-grade image ingestion boundary.

Responsibilities
----------------
- Validate uploaded images
- Securely store original files
- Generate thumbnails
- Calculate SHA-256 hashes
- Detect duplicates
- Create stable memory identifiers
- Persist upload metadata
- Trigger the REAL MemoryOS processing pipeline
- Expose original/preview image endpoints
- Support single and batch uploads
- Provide processing status
- Return frontend-friendly structured responses

Architecture
------------

Browser
   │
   ▼
POST /upload
   │
   ▼
Validation
   │
   ▼
SHA-256
   │
   ▼
Duplicate detection
   │
   ▼
Original + Thumbnail
   │
   ▼
backend.services.processing_service
   │
   ├── OCR
   ├── Vision / Gemini
   ├── Classification
   ├── Entities
   ├── Embedding
   ├── FAISS
   └── Database
   │
   ▼
Frontend JSON

IMPORTANT
---------
This module does NOT contain OCR, Gemini, embedding, FAISS,
or database intelligence.

Those responsibilities remain inside the existing
MemoryOS processing architecture.
"""

